graph TD
    A[查询执行完成<br/>Query Execution Complete] --> B[结果验证<br/>Result Validation]
    B --> C[提取ML特征<br/>Extract ML Features]
    C --> D[创建缓存条目<br/>Create Cache Entry]
    D --> E[添加到布隆过滤器<br/>Add to Bloom Filter]
    E --> F[插入内存缓存<br/>Insert to Memory Cache]
    
    F --> G{需要持久化?<br/>Need Persistence?}
    G --> |是<br/>Yes| H[异步持久化任务<br/>Async Persistence Task]
    G --> |否<br/>No| I[缓存更新完成<br/>Cache Update Complete]
    
    H --> J[WAL格式写入<br/>WAL Format Write]
    H --> K[物化视图创建<br/>Materialized View Creation]
    H --> L[索引更新<br/>Index Update]
    
    J --> M[持久化完成<br/>Persistence Complete]
    K --> M
    L --> M
    
    F --> N{需要淘汰?<br/>Need Eviction?}
    N --> |是<br/>Yes| O[执行淘汰策略<br/>Execute Eviction Strategy]
    N --> |否<br/>No| I
    
    O --> P[选择淘汰条目<br/>Select Eviction Candidates]
    P --> Q[移除缓存条目<br/>Remove Cache Entries]
    Q --> R[更新统计信息<br/>Update Statistics]
    R --> I
    
    style I fill:#e8f5e8
